{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/initial_question.png?t=1745022806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes! Pelican Harbor reimagines the way Rhythm Games work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You choose your favorite music\u00a0<strong>by simply listening to it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You only need your ears and a sense of rhythm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1) </strong><i>You imitate the beat of a song</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2) </strong><i>The game calculates its BPM</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3) </strong><i>You start fishing and the game generates different maps each time!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/bo_gif_3.gif?t=1745022806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leveling, Runes &amp; Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/runes_skills.png?t=1745022806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn experience points by catching or filleting fish, completing quests and burning materials. Upgrade specific skills and unlock runes which add small rhythm variations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rarities of Islands, Fish &amp; Fish Bait</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/rarities_page.png?t=1745022806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Islands, fish and fish bait are categorized by them. You start on an ordinary island with the goal to buy more rare islands. Your island's rarity sets the max. rarity of fish you can catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Filleting Fish &amp; Fish Bait</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/fillet_bait_page.png?t=1745022806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Either sell fish to gain Pico or fillet your fish for a chance of obtaining fish bait of the next higher rarity. Fishing with bait ensures a 50% catch rate of fish from this rarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/terraform_with_the_crew.gif?t=1745022806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Islands, Terraforming, Paths &amp; Placeable Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Islands are procedurally generated. You can terraform everything above sand level and create paths. Place objects like your camp or lighthouse freely to customize your island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">High Quality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built from scratch with a custom engine, Pelican Harbor excels in high performance and smooth gameplay, even on low-end systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/flying_with_the_crew.gif?t=1745022806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">... and more Features!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Co-op with up to 4 Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traveling NPCs</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell Fish or buy Tools, Accessories &amp; entire Islands</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pelican Customization</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face, Height, Body- &amp; Eye Color, Backpack- &amp; Hat Accessories</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3001740?t=1745022806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745022806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/b6a375e63ba67e56284d3711b5e3f08380b1ca5d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745022806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/b6a375e63ba67e56284d3711b5e3f08380b1ca5d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745022806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3001740/extras/initial_question.png?t=1745022806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes! Pelican Harbor reimagines the way Rhythm Games work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You choose your favorite music\u00a0<strong>by simply listening to it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You only need your ears and a sense of rhythm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p clas